                    used for internal timekeeping, among others by the
                    ‘Accidental_engraver’.

               ‘measureStartNow’ (boolean)
                    True at the beginning of a measure.

               ‘restNumberThreshold’ (number)
                    If a multi-measure rest has more measures than this,
                    a number is printed.

          This engraver creates the following layout object(s): *note
          MultiMeasureRest::, *note MultiMeasureRestNumber::, *note
          MultiMeasureRestScript:: and *note MultiMeasureRestText::.

     *note New_fingering_engraver::
          Create fingering scripts for notes in a new chord.  This
